node_modules/
dist/
.vercel/
.DS_Store
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Server state: the ledger and the house hot wallet. Never committed.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
house-keypair.json
# The bank test spins up its own throwaway house wallet and deletes it on every
# run. One got swept into the first commit: a real secret key, in what is now a
# public repo. The pattern, not the filename, so the next test harness that
# invents a name cannot repeat it.
*-house.json
*-keypair.json

# Raw art masters: green-screen generator output, chroma-keyed and packed into
# apps/web/public, where the only shipping copy lives. Nothing here ever ships
# directly. The masters were deleted on 2026-08-13 — the RECIPE is committed
# (art-drop/README.md has the exact prompts), so re-cropping or adding a
# character means regenerating from those prompts, not reaching for an
# original. The pattern stays so the next drop cannot be committed by accident.
art-drop/**/*.jpg
art-drop/**/*.png

# Python bytecode from the art pipeline
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Built output under any name. `dist/` alone missed `dist-demo/`, which is how
# a 2 MB build of the retired offline demo sat tracked in a public repo that is
# supposed to contain no demo at all.
dist-*/
